---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Cookie Policy"
  description="Cookie Policy for BBK Marketing Solutions LLC."
  effectiveDate="March 11, 2026"
  updatedDate="March 11, 2026"
>
  <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
  <p>
    This Cookie Policy explains how {site.legalName} (&ldquo;BBK Marketing&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;,
    &ldquo;us&rdquo;, or &ldquo;our&rdquo;) uses cookies and similar technologies when you visit our
    website.
  </p>
  <p>By continuing to browse or use our website, you agree to the use of cookies as described in this policy.</p>

  <h2>2. What Are Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They allow websites to
    recognize your device and store certain information about your preferences or previous actions.
  </p>
  <p>Cookies help improve the functionality, performance, and security of websites.</p>

  <h2>3. Types of Cookies We Use</h2>
  <p>Our website may use the following types of cookies:</p>
  <p><strong>Essential Cookies</strong></p>
  <p>These cookies are necessary for the basic operation of the website. They enable features such as:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Page navigation</li>
    <li>Secure access to certain areas</li>
    <li>Website functionality</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Without these cookies, some parts of the website may not work properly.</p>
  <p><strong>Analytics Cookies</strong></p>
  <p>These cookies help us understand how visitors interact with our website by collecting information such as:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Number of visitors</li>
    <li>Pages visited</li>
    <li>Time spent on the website</li>
    <li>Referral sources</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We may use tools such as Google Analytics to analyze website traffic and improve user experience.</p>
  <p><strong>Performance Cookies</strong></p>
  <p>Performance cookies help us monitor website performance and detect technical issues.</p>
  <p>These cookies help ensure that the website functions efficiently.</p>
  <p><strong>Marketing Cookies</strong></p>
  <p>Marketing cookies may be used to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Measure the effectiveness of advertising campaigns</li>
    <li>Track user engagement</li>
    <li>Improve marketing strategies</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These cookies may be associated with advertising platforms such as Meta (Facebook &amp; Instagram) or other digital marketing networks.</p>

  <h2>4. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
  <p>Some cookies may be placed by third-party services that appear on our website.</p>
  <p>These may include services such as:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Google Analytics</li>
    <li>Meta (Facebook Pixel)</li>
    <li>Embedded content providers</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These third parties may collect information according to their own privacy policies.</p>
  <p>{site.legalName} does not control these cookies.</p>

  <h2>5. How You Can Control Cookies</h2>
  <p>Most web browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings.</p>
  <p>You may choose to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Delete existing cookies</li>
    <li>Block future cookies</li>
    <li>Receive notifications when cookies are placed on your device</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Please note that disabling cookies may affect the functionality of certain parts of the website.</p>

  <h2>6. Updates to This Policy</h2>
  <p>{site.legalName} may update this Cookie Policy periodically.</p>
  <p>When updates are made, the &ldquo;Last Updated&rdquo; date at the top of this page will be revised.</p>
  <p>Users are encouraged to review this policy from time to time.</p>

  <h2>7. Contact Information</h2>
  <p>If you have any questions about this Cookie Policy, please contact:</p>
  <p>
    {site.legalName}<br />
    {site.address}<br />
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.privacyEmail}`}>{site.privacyEmail}</a><br />
    Phone: <a href={`tel:${site.privacyPhoneHref}`}>{site.privacyPhoneDisplay}</a>
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
